<title>MALAYSIA: KL Kepong 6-mth net down 3.9 pct.</title>
<headline>KL Kepong 6-mth net down 3.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 112.12   vs	 116.64</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 15.7    vs	  16.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   767.40   vs	 526.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   153.66   vs	 162.64</p>
<p>    Minorities	   add   5.15   vs  add    1.38</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    3.66   vs	 303.39</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Kuala Lumpur Kepong Bhd is engaged in the production and processing of palm oil products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
